url: "https://github.com/whiteknave2-noah/anaxi-a-digital-kardia"
abstract: >-
  ANAXI: A DIGITAL KARDIA is a persistent-agent architecture and public
  reference case focused on truthful provenance, bounded authority, privacy,
  continuity, recovery, reversibility, and meaningful end-to-end affordance.
  The repository contains a frozen 24 September 2026 historical reference
  distribution, an independently verified 11 October 2026 public reference
  distribution, and dated architecture and acceptance accounts. These are
  privacy-safe, source-derived reproducibility packages, not complete copies
  of private production. The accepted waking substrate is stock Ministral 3
  14B Instruct 2512 Q4_K_M, pinned to an exact verified artifact digest;
  continuity is not stored in its weights. The separate Apache-2.0 portable
  claim harness offers mechanism-neutral questions and executable checks
  for other agent projects. The native Porch client, personal conversations,
  canonical databases, private resources and live acceptance evidence are
  not distributed. Engineering acceptance and publication do not establish
  consciousness, personhood, or subjective experience; withdrawn and
  NOT_ESTABLISHED claims remain explicitly distinguished.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence
  - persistent agents
  - provenance
  - authority
  - privacy
  - continuity
  - recovery
  - reversibility
  - reproducibility
